1
00:00:03,237 --> 00:00:06,174
50 years have passed.

2
00:00:06,207 --> 00:00:10,111
But I do not age.

3
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:16,884
Time has lost its effect on me.

4
00:00:21,021 --> 00:00:24,858
Yet the suffering continues.

5
00:00:26,227 --> 00:00:32,533
Aku's grasp chokes the past,
present, and future.

6
00:00:32,566 --> 00:00:36,437
Hope is lost.

7
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:38,672
Got to get back --

8
00:00:38,706 --> 00:00:40,608
back to the past.

9
00:00:40,641 --> 00:00:42,343
Samurai Jack.

10
00:01:55,283 --> 00:01:56,950
Incredible.

11
00:01:56,984 --> 00:01:58,319
We should eat.

12
00:01:58,352 --> 00:02:00,354
This is going to be
a long journey.

13
00:02:03,724 --> 00:02:05,626
This looks good.

14
00:02:05,659 --> 00:02:08,596
Have you had it before?

15
00:02:08,629 --> 00:02:09,830
Yes, of course.

16
00:02:09,863 --> 00:02:11,799
Many, many times.

17
00:02:11,832 --> 00:02:13,967
Or something
very similar.

18
00:02:14,001 --> 00:02:16,537
Yah, yah,
all very good.

19
00:02:16,570 --> 00:02:18,138
Very good for you.

20
00:02:18,172 --> 00:02:20,474
See?
It is even good for you.

21
00:02:20,508 --> 00:02:22,710
This one especially.

22
00:02:23,377 --> 00:02:25,846
Mmm, mmm.

23
00:02:27,481 --> 00:02:30,684
Mmm. Delicious.

24
00:02:33,521 --> 00:02:35,055
Please, have some.

25
00:02:35,088 --> 00:02:37,225
No! Thank you, heh.

26
00:02:37,258 --> 00:02:40,228
I'll just try something
over here.

27
00:02:42,196 --> 00:02:45,766
Woman --
who understands them, yah?

28
00:02:46,767 --> 00:02:50,471
Yes...I guess.

29
00:03:07,621 --> 00:03:10,658
I don't feel so good.

30
00:03:10,691 --> 00:03:12,393
Maybe it was something
I ate?

31
00:03:12,426 --> 00:03:15,195
Yeah, that might be it.

32
00:03:16,730 --> 00:03:19,400
Ah, that's better.

33
00:03:31,979 --> 00:03:34,282
Excuse me.

34
00:03:35,316 --> 00:03:38,286
Pardon me.

35
00:03:45,293 --> 00:03:47,395
It's a little, uh...
crowded.

36
00:03:47,428 --> 00:03:48,696
Yes.

37
00:03:48,729 --> 00:03:51,265
Oh!
Something's poking me.

38
00:03:52,099 --> 00:03:53,634
Oh! I'm so sorry.

39
00:04:14,254 --> 00:04:15,556
Sorry, I --
No, I --

40
