45
00:04:27,801 --> 00:04:29,770
but our hands kept...
touching.

46
00:04:29,803 --> 00:04:32,139
Ha ha...ha.

47
00:04:32,172 --> 00:04:34,342
* Ba-da, ba-ba-ba-ba

48
00:04:34,375 --> 00:04:36,910
* Ba, ba

